    room-routing contract, named after the WebRTC signaling concept it relays),
    kotoba-lang/net -> kotoba-lang/io-libp2p (NOT a libp2p port -- explicitly simplified
    GossipSub/Bitswap-inspired semantics only, named after libp2p.io per owner direction --
